	itty stand-up comedy. Known for his clever observations and engaging stage
	 presence\, Sam Miller delivers laughs that resonate with audiences everyw
	here. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (D
	oors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Me
	morial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket
	 Prices: $20 – $24 \nAbout Sam Miller\nSam Miller is a nationally touring 
	stand-up comedian known for his sharp wit\, clever wordplay\, and relatabl
	e humor. He has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country
	\, building a dedicated following with his intelligent\, laugh-out-loud st
