	located in the Hobby Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are availabl
	e for parties of 10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of acces
	sibility options for guests.Learn more about accessible performances and o
	ther services here. \nRush tickets will be available for $35 at the box of
	fice for mezzanine and gallery seating starting 2 hours prior to curtain. 
